@title Work cards: the Build order strip prints the workshop pack
@area 3D
# 3D > Layers > Build order shows a strip with "Work cards (PDF)". It writes the half-page work cards (cover with tool list, tick-off sheet, one card per rail, duct, device and wire group) next to the project; keep_file copies the real PDF so it can be opened.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
click_text "Layers"
wait 8
click_text "Build order"
wait 8
key Escape
wait 30
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
shot strip-with-work-cards-button
expect "Work cards (PDF)"
check_layout
answer_dialog ~/Documents/KoperCAD/qa 183 work cards.pdf
click_text "Work cards (PDF)"
wait 40
shot after-print
expect_file "~/Documents/KoperCAD/qa 183 work cards.pdf" 3000
keep_file "~/Documents/KoperCAD/qa 183 work cards.pdf"
